      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.462
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "file": "S04.mp3",
      "text": "三个人挤在一间屋里，谁说了算，很快就分出了高下。",
      "sha256": "2a7c5edd9209f92c2feff3f58ff43565a4573dc50834a7e4c573d6882c9a87db",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S04",
      "target_start": 18,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.937,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.063
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "file": "S05.mp3",
      "text": "最后搬进来的那一个，慢慢成了屋里被使唤、被拿钱的人。",
      "sha256": "a2d639449ca765b8aba6fcd57e32514fbb9af6230fb4115639ddba8492f7e7ec",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S05",
      "target_start": 24,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.433,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.567
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "file": "S06.mp3",
      "text": "二〇一九年二月，三十一岁的犬饲，死在了这间屋里。",
      "sha256": "9f27544ada80469546d3070965a004aa95cbaf23b43fc6b39c4bea7da0524b56",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S06",
      "target_start": 30,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.538,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.462
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "file": "S07.mp3",
      "text": "解剖报告写的死因是头部外伤，她身上另有多处瘀伤。",
      "sha256": "46119a9cefaa07608041f67c79e44f6309627808e973ed9f9164637acc0e740a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S07",
      "target_start": 36,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.956,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.044
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "file": "S08.mp3",
      "text": "二月四日前后，她被装上车，运往六十公里外的山林。",
      "sha256": "0cd9b68f9f98d2ad9308b1ca7730fcfa5002e36752113da409fbdc6e1c6c2663",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S08",
      "target_start": 42,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "file": "S09.mp3",
      "text": "二十天后的清晨五点四十分，一个熟人拨通了报警电话。",
      "sha256": "9b5f952925664dabf23c3d135a501453b4c3492feb3697c6b5b21c8c0299338f",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S09",
      "target_start": 48,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.46,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.54
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "file": "S10.mp3",
      "text": "她带着警察进了山，找到遗体。两个女人随后被逮捕。",
      "sha256": "ed6d24f485e6ac169e09f42dba75cdd7ff5e2f82f87a6f3ca756f31a65647132",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S10",
      "target_start": 54,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.859,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.141
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "file": "S11.mp3",
      "text": "二〇二〇年七月，这起案子在名古屋地方法院宣判。",
      "sha256": "6a453f50204cf1a031728af81525b9262c48ad78c910ea67fe7656df48da116b",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S11",
      "target_start": 60,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 4.624,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 1.376
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "file": "S12.mp3",
      "text": "伤害致死判了无罪，只剩弃尸和盗窃两项。",
      "sha256": "5d691ceef52004f865968a63652463fc4817cc12fdcdca99371d845ac6015225",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S12",
      "target_start": 66,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.669,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.331
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "file": "S13.mp3",
      "text": "能证明有人动手致死的，几乎只有门田自己的那段供述。",
      "sha256": "138c32e8e718b0bf02c0cf878aca3347e6d61eb68498ab25d049125ad78035ae",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S13",
      "target_start": 72,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "file": "S14.mp3",
      "text": "可这段供述前后不一，法院没有采信，罪名因此不成立。",
      "sha256": "dae568740e8d40904925e87c1b50c03560f4f135bf036588f7ea83f0d152e085",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S14",
      "target_start": 78,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.146,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.854
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "file": "S15.mp3",
      "text": "石川二年八月、门田二年，都是缓刑四年，同月确定。",
      "sha256": "c05367876322febe2d39aa0a2d157f17e40017a60c702c9643799c8a1439699c",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
