      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "file": "S20.mp3",
      "text": "第二天，她被埋进东浦町的农田，身边只有土和水沟。",
      "sha256": "a905a9eedaa7ebdabdd534a83bd58ab43a5439b00303022f7875b8662bf75080",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S20",
      "target_start": 114,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.669,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.331
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "file": "S21.mp3",
      "text": "这起案子之所以能浮出水面，是两个人先因另案被捕。",
      "sha256": "7428f6644c172025c412063579766e094350b087191d37be579387f50ba02dcc",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S21",
      "target_start": 120,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.251,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.749
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "file": "S22.mp3",
      "text": "审讯中，天池说出她的下落。四月四日，警方找到了她。",
      "sha256": "c770ab9404979acec9574b690167546f08b10908009159c08f4ab6124e32b2fb",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S22",
      "target_start": 126,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.747,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.253
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "file": "S23.mp3",
      "text": "二〇二四年三月，天池由佳理被判有期徒刑十六年。",
      "sha256": "7cfa4f40dc0edb9283905f9656f475ea8cbe4837acfb425078ea25995c938283",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S23",
      "target_start": 132,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.355,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.645
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "file": "S24.mp3",
      "text": "同年七月，山下克己被判二十八年，他否认也没用。",
      "sha256": "0e9cb679a006928723b0dacb0fee4bc01fcca06a4a802ae29fba595b5c5c15e9",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S24",
      "target_start": 138,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.06,
      "atempo": 1.0101,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "file": "S25.mp3",
      "text": "两人都上诉，二审都维持原判。天池的案子，还在最高法院。",
      "sha256": "2ea35e1b208551ca94d33c2c68b0b2a5dc79babdd196f2dbc8e383a115072c3a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S25",
      "target_start": 144,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.139,
      "atempo": 1.0231,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "file": "S26.mp3",
      "text": "把两起案子并排放在一起，会看到一个让人不安的对称。",
      "sha256": "b31fc6d28751c4d3124702714a4e74fce2e91cdf9c134b2a43c49192a1154ac2",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S26",
      "target_start": 150,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 5.46,
      "atempo": 1.0,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.54
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "file": "S27.mp3",
      "text": "二〇一九年，她帮着埋了一个人；三年后，她自己被埋。",
      "sha256": "80ba766deb471292b8817dfe5307161d02709477e79758e8a45f34fca56820d1",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S27",
      "target_start": 156,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.008,
      "atempo": 1.0014,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "file": "S28.mp3",
      "text": "网上很多人说这就是因果报应，谁也躲不过去，传得很广。",
      "sha256": "1476d67af33923eb5646ea7c6e995e59a07762d8de1f9c3cd8e69caf47f6dd5a",
      "voice_id": "voice-03",
      "voice_description": "低沉悬疑纪录片男声（第26期主创 add_voice 试听选定 voice-03；克制压抑，实测约 4.8 字/秒）",
      "narration_id": "S28",
      "target_start": 162,
      "target_duration": 6,
      "alignment": "shot-locked",
      "source_duration": 6.139,
      "atempo": 1.0231,
      "tail_silence_seconds": 0.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "file": "S29.mp3",
